m with a critique; then a respond day. The end-of-unit record is carried unscored to the year-end check. Out: the math teaching (math) | Across math's scaling and shapes units, weeks 24 to 30, the last fit before the year-end check | Candidate: PRIME Depth.LE, "every" and "some" in a classification claim; California 4.1, the grade 4 cloze withdrawn | Recipes use foods from several named cultures, none ranked. Home language: rectA�ngulo and rectangle are cognates; cuadrado and square share a root but look different, so the card carries both. Agent reads: sensitivity |
